THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
----------------------

The project links against the following, which carry their own permissive
licences and are not covered by this document:

  * Windows Sockets, IP Helper API          - Microsoft Windows SDK
  * BCrypt / SystemFunction036             - Microsoft Windows SDK
  * Windows Image Component (WIC)          - Microsoft Windows SDK
  * WinHTTP                                - Microsoft Windows SDK
  * C runtime, statically linked (/MT)     - Microsoft Visual C++ runtime

No third-party source code is vendored into this repository. curl and OpenSSL
are used optionally at runtime by `tls-audit` and `http-audit` when they happen
to be installed; neither is bundled or redistributed here.

